Let's create an interactive prototype for a recipe app.

99
00:03:28,990 --> 00:03:29,750
To save some time,

100
00:03:29,750 --> 00:03:31,590
So, I've already run an example beforehand.

101
00:03:31,590 --> 00:03:33,860
Let me show you exactly how it works.

102
