129
00:04:25,179 --> 00:04:27,619
Plus, Figma Make has this one really cool feature.

130
00:04:27,619 --> 00:04:28,999
And that is version control.

131
00:04:28,999 --> 00:04:30,639
It saves the result of every single change you make,

132
00:04:30,639 --> 00:04:32,319
and saves each one as a separate version.

133
00:04:32,319 --> 00:04:34,240
You can switch between versions right on the page.

134
00:04:34,240 --> 00:04:35,460
and compare the differences after your edits.

135
00:04:35,460 --> 00:04:36,480
So what if you mess something up?

136
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:38,060
you can always switch back to the original version.

137
00:04:38,060 --> 00:04:41,120
There's also an even more intuitive feature called Magic Wand Editing.

138
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:43,320
If you feel like a component needs a little tweak,

139
00:04:43,320 --> 00:04:47,240
For example, let's change the color of this 'favorite' button from red to yellow.

140
00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:48,340
You don't have to type a thing.

141
00:04:48,340 --> 00:04:51,289
Just click on that magic wand button in the bottom-left corner.

142
00:04:51,289 --> 00:04:54,509
