144
00:04:57,569 --> 00:04:59,620
the color, the corner radius...

145
00:04:59,620 --> 00:05:02,620
This is a true WYSIWYG experience, which is just fantastic.

146
00:05:02,620 --> 00:05:04,420
Alright, the prototype is pretty much ready.

